; ..\src\BaseSw\Infra\Ssw\TC37A\Tricore\Ifx_Ssw_Infra.h	   158   *
; ..\src\BaseSw\Infra\Ssw\TC37A\Tricore\Ifx_Ssw_Infra.h	   159   * This API will disable ENDINIT functionality provided by CPU WDT Hardware module.
; ..\src\BaseSw\Infra\Ssw\TC37A\Tricore\Ifx_Ssw_Infra.h	   160   * User need to use this API call before modifying any ENDINIT protected register. User must
